Package: directCareAuth
Title: Shared Practice Authentication and Account Management
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R:
    person("Anthony W.", "Raborn", , "anthony@raborndecisionsciences.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Shared database access layer for authenticating and managing
    practice accounts in the shared Postgres `practices` table used by
    both directCareAnalytics and directCarePlanner. Provides connection
    handling, credential lookup, signup, password change, profile edit,
    login-attempt lockout, and a lightweight security-event audit log.
    Consumers pass an already-open DBI connection to every function
    except db_connect() itself.
License: Apache License (>= 2) | file LICENSE
Imports:
    bcrypt,
    DBI,
    httr2,
    openssl,
    RPostgres
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
